    "customfield_12313320": "<div style='font-weight:bold;color:red;text-align:center'>This project has a <a href=\"https://lucene.apache.org/core/discussion.html\">user mailing list and an IRC channel</a> for support. If you are looking for support, or if you are not sure whether the behavior that you are observing is expected or not, please discuss it there first.</div>",
    "customfield_12314134": null,
    "duedate": null,
    "customfield_12314132": null,
    "customfield_12314131": null,
    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12520218/comment/13091634",
          "id": "13091634",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=shaie",
            "name": "shaie",
            "key": "shaie",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Shai Erera",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Jerusalem"
          },
          "body": "Patch adds 3 test cases to TestTermVectors. If you don't apply the fix to IndexWriter, the tests which call addIndexes fail.\n\nIt also moves the setHasVectors call after merger.merge() in IndexWriter.\n\nBTW, if you omit the optimize() call and the fix to IW, the tests pass.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=shaie",
            "name": "shaie",
            "key": "shaie",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Shai Erera",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Jerusalem"
          },
          "created": "2011-08-26T06:48:31.401+0000",
          "updated": "2011-08-26T06:48:31.401+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12520218/comment/13091660",
          "id": "13091660",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=simonw",
            "name": "simonw",
            "key": "simonw",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Simon Willnauer",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "good catch Shai, Does this happen on 4.0 too? I don't think we have setHasVectors there anymore. I am just wondering since you put 4.0 as a fix version.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=simonw",
            "name": "simonw",
            "key": "simonw",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Simon Willnauer",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "created": "2011-08-26T07:45:30.584+0000",
          "updated": "2011-08-26T07:45:30.584+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12520218/comment/13091709",
          "id": "13091709",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=shaie",
            "name": "shaie",
            "key": "shaie",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Shai Erera",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Jerusalem"
          },
          "body": "You're right, it does not happen on trunk. I still want to commit the test cases to trunk too, so that we've got that covered there as well. Therefore I think I should keep the 4.0 fix version?\n\nThe problem is that SegmentMerger receives its FieldInfos from DocumentsWriter, and it knows whether to set hasVector according to what it receives. When you addDoc, DW has FieldInfos, but when you only addIndexes, DW doesn't.\n\nIn fact, the field infos are read only on IW open ... so even if I addIndexes(), commit(), addIndexes(), the field infos would still be missing. A workaround I see for now is to addIndexes(), close(), new IW(), continue with addIndexes() or optimize(). Which is ugly but it's a workaround until we release a new version. I'll try that.\n\nIf it's ok, I'll commit the fix to 3x and the tests-only to trunk.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=shaie",
            "name": "shaie",
            "key": "shaie",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Shai Erera",
            "active": true,
